        "ref": "657ac0e5cf42c45b03b93a662fd8237b6b0be49f",
        "text": "Let $m$ and $n$ be coprime natural numbers and let $k$ be fixed. The divisors $x$ of $mn$ with\n    $x^k \\mid mn$ are exactly the products $ab$ where $a \\mid m$, $a^k \\mid m$, $b \\mid n$, and\n    $b^k \\mid n$."
      }
    ],
